    "sentence_translations": [
      "11. The Eleventh Minute",
      "",
      "Mr. Gao and Miss Zhong were very happy.",
      "",
      "They said they wanted to watch a movie together and have coffee together in the future.",
      "",
      "Mr. Gao looked at Miss Zhong. Miss Zhong’s face was a little red.",
      "",
      "Miss Zhong looked at Mr. Gao. Mr. Gao’s face was also a little red.",
      "",
      "There was a kitten behind Mr. Gao.",
      "",
      "Miss Zhong saw the kitten and said, “Look! There is a kitten behind you.”",
      "",
      "Mr. Gao took a look and said, “This kitten is so small!”",
      "",
      "Miss Zhong really liked cats. She said, “He’s so beautiful! I want to take a look at him.”",
      "",
      "“Can he eat apples?” Mr. Gao said.",
      "",
      "Mr. Gao had an apple. He gave the apple to the kitten, but the kitten didn’t eat it.",
      "",
      "“Can he drink coffee? We’ll treat him to a cup of coffee,” Mr. Gao said.",
      "",
      "“No! Cats can’t drink coffee!” Miss Zhong said.",
      "",
      "“I know, I know,” Mr. Gao smiled. Miss Zhong also smiled."
    ]
  }
